Recommends: docker.io | docker-ce
Description: REST API + CLI managing per-school FreeRADIUS containers
 Control plane that provisions and reconciles per-school FreeRADIUS (WLAN 802.1X)
 Docker containers: AD-backed EAP auth, a control-plane CA issuing EAP server
 certs, per-client shared secrets, and digest-pinned, health-checked, auto-rolling
 updates. Ships a self-contained Python virtualenv under /opt/linuxmuster-radius.
